      "name": "Problem Section",
      "settings": {
        "custom_css_class": "cst-prob-sec",
        "eyebrow": "Why PHASIS Exists",
        "heading_line1": "The Industry Has",
        "heading_em": "Four Serious Problems.",
        "intro": "<p>The supplement industry is worth over $150 billion globally. Most of it is <strong>underdosed, mislabeled, or built around ingredients that have no clinical support.</strong> We built PHASIS to be the exception to each of these.</p>",
        "res_label": "The PHASIS Response",
        "res_text": "<p>Every product we make is <em><strong>third-party tested, clinically informed, transparently labeled, and fairly priced</strong></em><em>.</em> That's the baseline. Not a differentiator — the minimum standard.</p>"
