        "text": "<p>FASE began on the mats. During a jiu-jitsu tournament, Jonathan fought through intense headlocks until severe neck cramping set in. On the verge of quitting, he remembered a CBD balm a friend had given him and kept in his bag. He applied the simple beeswax and CBD balm; the cramping eased almost instantly, and he returned to the mats. </p><p>That moment shifted his perspective. He saw how undervalued the topical was and how powerful natural ingredients could be when used with intention. The initial goal was straightforward: create a more complex balm than the one he had used and make an overall better product. He spent weeks experimenting and refining the formula until it met his standard.  </p><p>Once he perfected it, the vision expanded. He began to see the potential for a brand built not only on products, but on a way of living—one focused on evolving both physically and mentally. From that realization, FASE took shape.</p>",
        "button_label": "",
        "button_link": "",
